  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6cf31954afe79db3",
      "translationZh": "将可信访问模型引入 Artificial Analysis Cyber Index",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6fe88c741aa3c6f",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Sol (Daybreak Blue) 现已领跑 Cyber Index",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f0cff31631b939c",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis Cyber Index Alliance 汇聚行业合作伙伴，评估 AI 模型在企业网络防御任务中的表现。该指数推出时仅涵盖可公开访问的模型，为用户提供有关公开可用模型在智能体式网络防御方面能力的最佳参考。如今，我们正在扩展排行榜，将网络安全护栏更少的模型纳入其中，以更全面地展现前沿模型的网络安全能力。首个纳入的此类模型是 GPT-6 Sol (Daybreak Blue, max)，它仅可通过 OpenAI 的 Daybreak 计划访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00a1b5f465b0604e",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Sol (Daybreak Blue, max) 现已领跑该指数，并位于成本与能力的帕累托前沿。在整个指数的评测中，它未触发任何安全拦截，总体得分比公开可用的 GPT-6 Sol (max) 高出 32 分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d188b491f6323a50",
      "translationZh": "其每项任务成本为 1.77，比其他领先模型更具成本效益，包括每项任务成本为 11.67 的 Grok 4.7 (xhigh)。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4faeaa4576d1230",
      "translationZh": "与公开可用的 GPT-6 Sol 相比，Daybreak Blue 模型在 CyberGym-E2E 上的提升最大，而这也是我们观察到安全拒绝最多的基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3f72fea88a203aa",
      "translationZh": "我们将继续扩展 Artificial Analysis Cyber Index，使其同时覆盖公开可用模型和可信访问模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f1acd6ba0ae23c2",
      "translationZh": "完整评测结果请见：https://artificialanalysis.ai/evaluations/artificial-analysis-cyber-index",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c74ced96d2d930c",
      "translationZh": "发布 Harvey LAB-AA v1.1：新增幻觉检查，提高智能体法律工作的标准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75b244644f31943e",
      "translationZh": "Harvey LAB-AA v1.1 新增幻觉审计，引入全新的核心指标“幻觉门控全项通过率（Hallucination-Gated All-Pass Rate）”、由三名评审组成的评分小组，以及 Harvey 最新的私有数据集，其中的任务和评判标准均有所改进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f154bff3273d12e1",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 已发布 Claude Haiku 5.5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0119949ae64d903d",
